  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "One Gu is cubic and called Regulations. The other is spherical and called Rules.",
        "chapters": [
          38
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "A later clan telling repeats the pair as one round and one square.",
        "chapters": [
          58
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When Ren Zu orders a world capture, Rules Gu becomes a giant circle and Regulation Gu a giant square.",
        "chapters": [
          58
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Working together they catch an eighty-year Longevity Gu for Ren Zu, and after he consumes it his body returns to that of a twenty year old. Before Rules is named, Regulations alone tells Ren Zu that only with its brother can it aid in capturing all Gu in the world; its ability alone is not enough.",
        "chapters": [
          38
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "capture-ability",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Gu Yue Bo later retells that after the first capture, each new command adds a rule and regulation. The first added limit is that they will not catch the same Gu for him again. Ren Zu then orders them to catch every Gu other than Longevity Gu. Rules Gu becomes a giant circle and Regulation Gu a giant square; as a net they enclose the world and bring back every Gu but Longevity Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          58
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "capture-ability",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_gu_yue_bo"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Ren Zu opens the net, most of the Gu escape. The pair explain that they can only capture Gu for him, and that subduing those Gu still depends on Ren Zu himself. A second new rule follows: from then on they can catch only one Gu for him at a time.",
        "chapters": [
          58
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "capture-ability",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
